{"id":"658403","name":"糯米糍糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658403/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"小麦淀粉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"烤花生米","amount":"50g"},{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"20"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米粉里加入小麦淀粉（即澄面）、烤花生，炒芝麻。","img":"images/658403/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"再准备适量的红糖，白砂糖。","img":"images/658403/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把米放入石臼中碾碎，带有颗粒状最佳。","img":"images/658403/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碾好的花生和芝麻放入碗内。","img":"images/658403/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入红糖和白糖。","img":"images/658403/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀后加入10克玉米油。","img":"images/658403/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调好的馅料。","img":"images/658403/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"糯米粉里加入开水。","img":"images/658403/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"和成团后加入5g玉米油。","img":"images/658403/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次揉搓成团。","img":"images/658403/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取一块面剂，搓成球，再捏成小窝状。","img":"images/658403/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/658403/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/658403/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"密封好。","img":"images/658403/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"按压成饼状。","img":"images/658403/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"依次做完。","img":"images/658403/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"饼胚表面刷上水。","img":"images/658403/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"撒上白芝麻。","img":"images/658403/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"平底锅热油，小饼入锅煎。","img":"images/658403/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/658403/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"鼓起来即熟了。","img":"images/658403/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"糯米糍糕做好了。","img":"images/658403/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"表面酥香，一口爆汁！","img":"images/658403/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}